# Sequence Diagram

# Module 10 AI Director Sequence (Mermaid)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram

participant User
participant Director as AI Director
participant Story as Story Intelligence
participant Character as Character Intelligence
participant Prompt as Prompt Intelligence
participant QA as Quality Intelligence
participant Production as Production Engine
participant Runtime as AI Studio Runtime

User->>Director: Submit Story Request

Director->>Story: Analyze Story Blueprint
Story-->>Director: Story Plan

Director->>Character: Validate Character DNA
Character-->>Director: Character Plan

Director->>Prompt: Generate Prompt Package
Prompt-->>Director: Optimized Prompts

Director->>QA: Execute Quality Gates
QA-->>Director: PASS / FAIL

alt QA PASS
    Director->>Production: Build Production Package
    Production-->>Director: Production Package
    Director->>Runtime: Release Package
    Runtime-->>User: Production Ready
else QA FAIL
    QA-->>Director: Issue Report
    Director->>Story: Request Revision
end
```

---

# Purpose

Mô tả trình tự tương tác giữa người dùng, AI Director và các thành phần cốt lõi trong quá trình tạo Production Package.

---

# Main Flow

1. User gửi Story Request.
2. AI Director phân tích Story.
3. Character được kiểm tra và đồng bộ.
4. Prompt được sinh và tối ưu.
5. QA kiểm tra chất lượng.
6. Nếu PASS → tạo Production Package và Release.
7. Nếu FAIL → quay lại bước chỉnh sửa Story.

